+# Fork extension
+
+Add this extension to the agent directory's `settings.json`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "extensions": ["/absolute/path/to/pi/packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/fork/index.ts"]
+}
+```
+
+The `fork` tool takes `{ "task": "..." }`. It starts a separate pi process with a snapshot of the current model context, the current model and thinking level, and the same agent settings. The parent continues working. When the fork exits, pi adds a visible `fork-result` message containing its answer or failure reason. Fork sessions are saved beside the parent session and point to it through `parentSession`.
+
+Forks cannot start further forks. Leaving the parent session stops its running forks. The extension requires a persisted session and Node 22 or later.
diff --git a/packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/fork/index.ts b/packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/fork/index.ts
